		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=43659#p43659"><![CDATA[
<strong class="text-strong">btBvhTriangleMeshShape</strong> only supports static objects, not objects with non-zero velocity.  For dynamic objects use <strong class="text-strong">btCompoundShape</strong> with convex decompositions of your concave shapes, or maybe the <strong class="text-strong">GImpactShapes</strong>.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=11033">drleviathan</a> — Mon Oct 25, 2021 3:07 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
